<body>
    <h1>Curated Conforming</h1>
    <div class=3D"Section1">
        <p>A key objective in building an Enterprise Data Model and not a c=
ollection of data marts is the shared dimensionality and also the conformit=
y.&nbsp; This is where multiple sources load into the model but look the sa=
me once they are there.&nbsp; That comes down to conforming definitions but=
 also physically the data.</p>
<p>In order to manage this conformity and the mapping of source values to a=
greed conformed values, we have created a normalised conforming model which=
 also provides audit-ability by showing source tables, columns and values t=
o the agreed value.</p>
<p>Curated Conforming (curated_cnf) is the structure that is used to manage=
 the conforming of raw source values in Silver into agreed values for Gold =
or the Business Vault.&nbsp; This is a physical set of tables, a subset of =
which are resolved in a view for the load mechanism to conform. The wider m=
odel also links to business glossary terms.</p>
<p><span class=3D"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper"><img class=3D"confluenc=
e-embedded-image" draggable=3D"false" src=3D"e2c3658f9c2c00d1466b2d39d1a2e8=
742eeba74c41b71077c1124e181163dc0c" data-image-src=3D"/download/attachments=
/160793802/image2022-9-29_10-52-3.png?version=3D1&amp;modificationDate=3D16=
64445123000&amp;api=3Dv2" data-unresolved-comment-count=3D"0" data-linked-r=
esource-id=3D"160793831" data-linked-resource-version=3D"1" data-linked-res=
ource-type=3D"attachment" data-linked-resource-default-alias=3D"image2022-9=
-29_10-52-3.png" data-base-url=3D"https://confluence.group.net" data-linked=
-resource-content-type=3D"image/png" data-linked-resource-container-id=3D"1=
60793802" data-linked-resource-container-version=3D"8" tabindex=3D"0" alt=
=3D"" width=3D"468" height=3D"254"></span></p>
<p><br></p>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
 <table class=3D"wrapped confluenceTable">
  <colgroup>
   <col>
   <col>
  </colgroup>
  <tbody>
   <tr>
    <th class=3D"confluenceTh">Table Name</th>
    <th class=3D"confluenceTh">Description</th>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>curated_cnf.business_term</p></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">Holds the business term and definition of wh=
at you are conforming</td>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>curated_cnf.cnfrmd_source_value</p></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">Resolves the relationship between the source=
 value, conformed value and source location</td>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <td colspan=3D"1" class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>curated_cnf.business_cnfrmd_value</p></td>
    <td colspan=3D"1" class=3D"confluenceTd">Holds the acceptable value tha=
t will be conformed to</td>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <td colspan=3D"1" class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>curated_cnf.table_column</p></td>
    <td colspan=3D"1" class=3D"confluenceTd">Holds the source table informa=
tion for the raw data to be conformed</td>
   </tr>
  </tbody>
 </table>
</div>
<p><br></p>
<p><br></p>
<p>This is resolved and will be used by a view:&nbsp; <strong>curated_cnf.c=
nfrmd_business_term_value_mapping</strong></p>
<p>As multiple source columns and values may be required to conform to a si=
ngle value, this view pivots out the data.</p>
<p><span class=3D"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper confluence-embedded-manu=
al-size"><img class=3D"confluence-embedded-image" draggable=3D"false" heigh=
t=3D"16" src=3D"463dbd2f83c6291d01dc1094171210e09f6438a46e617161a3ec14efc21=
ced47" data-image-src=3D"/download/attachments/160793802/image2022-9-29_11-=
0-48.png?version=3D1&amp;modificationDate=3D1664445648000&amp;api=3Dv2" dat=
a-unresolved-comment-count=3D"0" data-linked-resource-id=3D"160793836" data=
-linked-resource-version=3D"1" data-linked-resource-type=3D"attachment" dat=
a-linked-resource-default-alias=3D"image2022-9-29_11-0-48.png" data-base-ur=
l=3D"https://confluence.group.net" data-linked-resource-content-type=3D"ima=
ge/png" data-linked-resource-container-id=3D"160793802" data-linked-resourc=
e-container-version=3D"8" tabindex=3D"0" alt=3D"" width=3D"468"></span></p>
<p><br></p>
<p>In the above example, it identifies that from CQS, you need to use 1 sou=
rce table and the combination of dta in 3 columns to successfully join to c=
onform to the CNFRMD_VALUE_TXT.<br><br></p>
<p>It is this CNFRMD_VALUE_TXT that will be loaded to Gold.</p>
<p>All of this will be populated after analysis of what is required to iden=
tify the conformed values.</p>
<p><br></p>
<h1 id=3D"CuratedConforming-Howtousecurated_cnf">How to use curated_cnf</h1=
>
<p><br></p>
<h2 id=3D"CuratedConforming-UsageFlow1-ConformingRawDataVault(Silver)toEDM(=
Gold)">Usage Flow 1 - Conforming Raw Data Vault (Silver) to EDM (Gold)</h2>
<p><span class=3D"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper confluence-embedded-manu=
al-size"><img class=3D"confluence-embedded-image" draggable=3D"false" heigh=
t=3D"214" src=3D"4cbb8224e379062ed910b0da62d12a059d81d407b558631752d3d18826=
21badb" data-image-src=3D"/download/attachments/160793802/image2022-9-29_10=
-49-14.png?version=3D1&amp;modificationDate=3D1664444954000&amp;api=3Dv2" d=
ata-unresolved-comment-count=3D"0" data-linked-resource-id=3D"160793829" da=
ta-linked-resource-version=3D"1" data-linked-resource-type=3D"attachment" d=
ata-linked-resource-default-alias=3D"image2022-9-29_10-49-14.png" data-base=
-url=3D"https://confluence.group.net" data-linked-resource-content-type=3D"=
image/png" data-linked-resource-container-id=3D"160793802" data-linked-reso=
urce-container-version=3D"8" tabindex=3D"0" alt=3D"" width=3D"468"></span><=
/p>
<p><br></p>
<h2 id=3D"CuratedConforming-UsageFlow2-ConformingRawDataVault(Silver)toBusi=
nessVault(Silver)toEDM(Gold)">Usage Flow 2 - Conforming Raw Data Vault (Sil=
ver) to Business Vault (Silver) to EDM (Gold)</h2>
<p><br></p>
<p><span class=3D"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper confluence-embedded-manu=
al-size"><img class=3D"confluence-embedded-image" draggable=3D"false" heigh=
t=3D"168" src=3D"c7bd12d6f4180ddc4a2661d6c4c370d89ffc200d3ba80cce162b32f63e=
ba8904" data-image-src=3D"/download/attachments/160793802/image2022-9-29_10=
-50-29.png?version=3D1&amp;modificationDate=3D1664445029000&amp;api=3Dv2" d=
ata-unresolved-comment-count=3D"0" data-linked-resource-id=3D"160793830" da=
ta-linked-resource-version=3D"1" data-linked-resource-type=3D"attachment" d=
ata-linked-resource-default-alias=3D"image2022-9-29_10-50-29.png" data-base=
-url=3D"https://confluence.group.net" data-linked-resource-content-type=3D"=
image/png" data-linked-resource-container-id=3D"160793802" data-linked-reso=
urce-container-version=3D"8" tabindex=3D"0" alt=3D"" width=3D"468"></span><=
/p>
<p><br></p>
<h2 id=3D"CuratedConforming-UsageCodeExample1-InaFacttoconformtoReferenceDi=
mensionAttributes">Usage Code Example 1 - In a Fact to conform to Reference=
 Dimension Attributes</h2>
<p>In this example, we look at being able to generate the dimension hash ke=
y from the fact query so that we get the correct join to a reference dimens=
ion.</p>
<p>SELECT&nbsp;</p>
<p><span class=3D"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper confluence-embedded-manu=
al-size"><img class=3D"confluence-embedded-image" draggable=3D"false" heigh=
t=3D"12" src=3D"02a8e8f182f02311b44747601b481dd35ab99d3aa57d8641b43a978f3f7=
fbac2" data-image-src=3D"/download/attachments/160793802/image2022-9-29_11-=
49-55.png?version=3D1&amp;modificationDate=3D1664448595000&amp;api=3Dv2" da=
ta-unresolved-comment-count=3D"0" data-linked-resource-id=3D"160793883" dat=
a-linked-resource-version=3D"1" data-linked-resource-type=3D"attachment" da=
ta-linked-resource-default-alias=3D"image2022-9-29_11-49-55.png" data-base-=
url=3D"https://confluence.group.net" data-linked-resource-content-type=3D"i=
mage/png" data-linked-resource-container-id=3D"160793802" data-linked-resou=
rce-container-version=3D"8" tabindex=3D"0" alt=3D"" width=3D"468"></span></=
p>
<p>(</p>
<p>SELECT DATA REQUIRED FOR FACT</p>
<p>)&nbsp; fact_base</p>
<p><span class=3D"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper confluence-embedded-manu=
al-size"><img class=3D"confluence-embedded-image" draggable=3D"false" heigh=
t=3D"70" src=3D"63ccc91f67b97754afa171dbaa1665a8f8b7f584c4ec0aa7b54d3f305c7=
a4e36" data-image-src=3D"/download/attachments/160793802/image2022-9-29_11-=
49-16.png?version=3D1&amp;modificationDate=3D1664448556000&amp;api=3Dv2" da=
ta-unresolved-comment-count=3D"0" data-linked-resource-id=3D"160793882" dat=
a-linked-resource-version=3D"1" data-linked-resource-type=3D"attachment" da=
ta-linked-resource-default-alias=3D"image2022-9-29_11-49-16.png" data-base-=
url=3D"https://confluence.group.net" data-linked-resource-content-type=3D"i=
mage/png" data-linked-resource-container-id=3D"160793802" data-linked-resou=
rce-container-version=3D"8" tabindex=3D"0" alt=3D"" width=3D"468"></span></=
p>
<p>This example uses a field in a fact query called TRANNAME (which matches=
 the source table column) and joins to the conformed mapping view.</p>
<p><span class=3D"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper confluence-embedded-manu=
al-size"><img class=3D"confluence-embedded-image" draggable=3D"false" heigh=
t=3D"46" src=3D"d0c1308ef652c269bbfb2a5a28fb0d68ae0008d2ebbc5686b4c12d8bb02=
5f4de" data-image-src=3D"/download/attachments/160793802/image2022-9-29_11-=
54-56.png?version=3D1&amp;modificationDate=3D1664448896000&amp;api=3Dv2" da=
ta-unresolved-comment-count=3D"0" data-linked-resource-id=3D"160793887" dat=
a-linked-resource-version=3D"1" data-linked-resource-type=3D"attachment" da=
ta-linked-resource-default-alias=3D"image2022-9-29_11-54-56.png" data-base-=
url=3D"https://confluence.group.net" data-linked-resource-content-type=3D"i=
mage/png" data-linked-resource-container-id=3D"160793802" data-linked-resou=
rce-container-version=3D"8" tabindex=3D"0" alt=3D"" width=3D"468"></span></=
p>
<p>The select at the top uses the conformed value instead to generate the c=
orrect key, defaulting to 'UNK' if it didn't join, which is the Unknown def=
ault row on the transaction type dimension.</p>
<p>Using curated_cnf to populate a Business Vault will behave in the same m=
anner as this.</p>
<h2 id=3D"CuratedConforming-UsageCodeExample2-ConformingtoABIAttributesinaD=
imensionLoad">Usage Code Example 2 - Conforming to ABI Attributes in a Dime=
nsion Load</h2>
<p>In this example, we are conforming source fields to ABI and use a specif=
ic function in case of no values returning</p>
<p>SELECT</p>
<p><span class=3D"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper confluence-embedded-manu=
al-size"><img class=3D"confluence-embedded-image" draggable=3D"false" heigh=
t=3D"22" src=3D"650eba2e24d0971f6bc478b3b1a4bfc0b9ba2183cc4cfae21e73f9e367d=
efb4f" data-image-src=3D"/download/attachments/160793802/image2022-9-29_11-=
57-20.png?version=3D1&amp;modificationDate=3D1664449040000&amp;api=3Dv2" da=
ta-unresolved-comment-count=3D"0" data-linked-resource-id=3D"160793891" dat=
a-linked-resource-version=3D"1" data-linked-resource-type=3D"attachment" da=
ta-linked-resource-default-alias=3D"image2022-9-29_11-57-20.png" data-base-=
url=3D"https://confluence.group.net" data-linked-resource-content-type=3D"i=
mage/png" data-linked-resource-container-id=3D"160793802" data-linked-resou=
rce-container-version=3D"8" tabindex=3D"0" alt=3D"" width=3D"468"></span></=
p>
<p>(</p>
<p>SELECT DATA REQUIRED FOR DIMENSION</p>
<p>) INSURED_OBJECT_PROPERTY_SOURCE</p>
<p><span class=3D"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper confluence-embedded-manu=
al-size"><img class=3D"confluence-embedded-image" draggable=3D"false" heigh=
t=3D"89" src=3D"5849358dc952a02f84146bfa57b358a05b350015d397636d2b2485b1df7=
181b5" data-image-src=3D"/download/attachments/160793802/image2022-9-29_11-=
57-2.png?version=3D1&amp;modificationDate=3D1664449022000&amp;api=3Dv2" dat=
a-unresolved-comment-count=3D"0" data-linked-resource-id=3D"160793889" data=
-linked-resource-version=3D"1" data-linked-resource-type=3D"attachment" dat=
a-linked-resource-default-alias=3D"image2022-9-29_11-57-2.png" data-base-ur=
l=3D"https://confluence.group.net" data-linked-resource-content-type=3D"ima=
ge/png" data-linked-resource-container-id=3D"160793802" data-linked-resourc=
e-container-version=3D"8" tabindex=3D"0" alt=3D"" width=3D"468"></span></p>
<p>This example works much in the same way, but we are not looking to gener=
ate a key, we are passing that data into a function FNC_EDM_CNF_NULL along =
with a type of what it should be (CD or DESC).</p>
<p>This then returns defaults for codes and descriptions where it doesn't m=
ap.</p>
<p><strong>-1</strong> for a missing code mapping</p>
<p><strong>No Mapping Found</strong> for a missing description mapping</p>
<h1 id=3D"CuratedConforming-Populatingthecurated_cnfModel">Populating the c=
urated_cnf Model</h1>
<p>SharePoint link to the spreadsheet used for populating the conforming ta=
bles:&nbsp;<a class=3D"external-link" href=3D"https://lvchange/td/operation=
al/giportfolio/Team/Business%20Change/GI%20Business%20Intelligence/BI%20Dev=
elopment/EDM/Curated_Cnf_Generator.xlsx?web=3D1" rel=3D"nofollow">Curated C=
onforming Spreadsheet</a></p>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
